### Component Architecture
All drug development components should follow this structure:

```typescript
interface DrugDevelopmentDemo {
  api: string; // e.g., "/predict_variant_impact"
  problem: string; // The traditional failure mode
  solution: string; // Our AI-powered approach
  evidence: {
    metric: string; // e.g., "95% AUROC"
    source: string; // e.g., "Evo 2 Paper, Methods 4.3.16"
  };
  interactive: React.ComponentType; // Live demo component
}
```

