## Implementation Commands

When building drug development features, always ask:
1. **Does this advance our drug development doctrine?**
2. **Does this show how we solve the $2.6B problem?**
3. **Is this backed by real evidence metrics?**
4. **Can users immediately see the competitive advantage?**

This doctrine should guide every decision in our platform development, ensuring we stay focused on our core mission of transforming drug development through AI engineering.